# Recorder A for the L2-ERR-005 merge cases: an errored record and the
# SPURIOUS_DATA continuation the card wrote after it, stamped 10 us later.
# The continuation takes the error's time (.000500), not its own (.000510),
# so a merge cannot interleave another recorder's record between the two.

# RT15 SA11 Receive, ERRORED (Type Word bit 14) @ .000500
0248 0F18 20DB F401 7E79 0000 0000 1E01

# SPURIOUS_DATA continuation -> 0x2000, stamped @ .000510
2005 0F18 20DB FE01 0000
